tests[1]{command,scope}:
  npm run coverage,project
close_reason: "Reworked PR #52: brought scripts/coverage-gate.ts under the gate via an in-process exported runCoverageGate entry (measured, not asserted), and re-decided all 9 deleted branches against the real SDK. Restored+covered 3 defensive helpers (renderedCommandResult newline ternary, markdownEscape nullish guard, byIdOrFail throw) with direct tests. Removed 6 with cited evidence: the readSettings try/catch (readSettings is hermetically non-throwing, verified empirically across 16 pathological roots and in core/store/settings.js), the neighbor-depth ??MAX fallback (BFS construction invariant), and ctx.options/ctx.global guards (non-optional on CommandHandlerContext, core/extensions/extension-types.d.ts). coverageGate.sources now includes scripts/coverage-gate.ts; ignore stays empty; thresholds 100/100/100. The gate reports three files at 100.00/100.00/100.00."
body: ""
